Generate a standalone C reproducer that triggers this vulnerability:

File: contrib/iptcutil/iptcutil.c
Line: 161
Function: convertHTMLcodes
Bug type: heap-buffer-overflow
CWE: CWE-122
Explanation: strcpy(s + 1, s + 1 + o) copies within the same buffer with overlapping source and destination. Using strcpy with overlapping regions is undefined behavior and can corrupt heap memory. Use memmove to safely handle overlap.

